{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/dotnet-isolated","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:06.416Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azure-functions/dotnet-isolated/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azure-functions/dotnet-isolated/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nThese images contain the Azure Functions runtime and the corresponding application stack (dotnet, node,\npython, powerShell, java) for running functions written in that language.\n\n## Featured Tags\n\n- `4`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/dotnet:4-dotnet8.0`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/dotnet-isolated:4-dotnet-isolated9.0`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/dotnet-isolated:4-dotnet-isolated8.0`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/node:4-node22`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/python:4-python3.10`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/python:4-python3.11`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/python:4-python3.12`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/python:4-python3.13`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/powershell:4-powershell7.4`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/powershell:4-powershell7.6`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/java:4-java8`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/java:4-java11`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/java:4-java17`\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/java:4-java21`\n\n### Related repositories\n\n- [Azure Functions Host](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-host/) - the Azure Functions runtime/host\n- [Azure WebJobs SDK](https://github.com/Azure/azure-webjobs-sdk/) - the \"core\" of the Azure Functions runtime and many bindings\n- [Azure WebJobs SDK extensions](https://github.com/Azure/azure-webjobs-sdk-extensions/) - the repositories of many bindings\n- [Durable Functions](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-durable-extension/) - the Durable Functions binding extension\n- [Durable Functions for JavaScript](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-durable-js) - the durable-functions npm module\n- [Azure Functions Core Tools](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-core-tools) - the command line tool for Azure Functions\n- [Azure Functions .NET Worker](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-dotnet-worker) - support for running .NET (isolated) functions\n- [Azure Functions NodeJS Worker](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-nodejs-worker) - support for running JavaScript functions\n- [Azure Functions Java Worker](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-java-worker) - support for running Java functions\n- [Azure Functions Python Worker](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-python-worker) - support for running Python functions\n- [Azure Functions UX](https://github.com/azure/azure-functions-ux) - the UX for the Functions development portal\n- [Azure Functions templates](https://github.com/azure/azure-functions-templates) - the templates which show up in the Azure Functions portal, Visual Studio, Visual Studio Code, etc\n- [Azure Functions samples](https://github.com/azure/azure-webjobs-sdk-script-samples) - repository for some samples on how the runtime works\n- [Azure Functions VS Tooling](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-vs-build-sdk) - msbuild tasks for precompiled functions\n\n## Usage\n\nAzure Functions Core Tools can help you select the right image for the platform you're interested in.\nYou can do that by running `func init --docker`.\nYou can see documentation on how to use custom docker containers with Azure Functions projects [here](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-functions/functions-create-function-linux-custom-image)\n\n## Container sample: Run a simple application\n\nYou can quickly run any of the containers above with the following command:\n\n```console\ndocker run --rm -p 8080:80 mcr.microsoft.com/azure-functions/dotnet:4\n```\n\n## Support\n\n- [File an Azure Functions Docker issue](https://github.com/Azure/azure-functions-docker/issues)\n- [Contact Microsoft Support](https://support.microsoft.com/contactus/)\n- [Ask on the Azure Functions forum](https://social.msdn.microsoft.com/Forums/azure/en-US/home?forum=AzureFunctions)\n- [Ask on Stack Overflow](http://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/azure-functions)\n- [Submit Azure Functions feedback](https://feedback.azure.com/forums/355860-azure-functions)\n- [Follow @AzureFunctions on Twitter](https://twitter.com/azurefunctions)\n\n## License\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\n### Documentation\n\n- [Azure Functions Overview](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-overview/)\n- [Azure Functions Concepts](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-reference/)\n- [Azure Functions C# developer reference](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-reference-csharp/)\n- [Azure Functions Node.js developer reference](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-reference-node/)\n- [Azure Functions bindings & triggers](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-triggers-bindings/)\n- [Durable Functions Overview](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/azure-functions/durable/durable-functions-overview/)\n- [Azure Functions getting started](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-create-first-azure-function/)\n- [Azure Functions sample: webhooks](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-create-a-web-hook-or-api-function/)\n- [Azure Functions sample: event processing](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-create-an-event-processing-function/)\n- [Azure Functions sample: azure services](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-create-an-azure-connected-function/)\n- [Testing an Azure Function](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-test-a-function/)\n- [Scaling a Function](https://azure.microsoft.com/documentation/articles/functions-scale/)\n- [Building the Azure Functions runtime locally](https://github.com/Azure/azure-webjobs-sdk-script/wiki)\n\n### Samples\n\n- [Serverless Community Library](https://serverlesslibrary.net/)\n- [Azure Functions samples](https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Functions/wiki/Samples-and-content)\n- [Durable Functions samples](https://github.com/azure/azure-functions-durable-extension)","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-24T18:28:55.9799696+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"888.6M+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"4-dotnet-isolated11.0-appservice-ussec-stage1","digest":"sha256:962cc41fa2495adf86e898b3783b522bbcc9be9371847688d59e88e5ad27b8ee","pushed":"2026-09-24T18:28:56.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"4-dotnet-isolated11.0-appservice-bleu-stage1","digest":"sha256:962cc41fa2495adf86e898b3783b522bbcc9be9371847688d59e88e5ad27b8ee","pushed":"2026-09-24T18:28:51.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"4-dotnet-isolated11.0-appservice-delos-stage1","digest":"sha256:962cc41fa2495adf86e898b3783b522bbcc9be9371847688d59e88e5ad27b8ee","pushed":"2026-09-24T18:28:44.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"4-dotnet-isolated10.0-appservice-ussec-stage1","digest":"sha256:4ad56c91448decbf7cac87d561efa30f4b831849afb46c2b68a2911505feb89e","pushed":"2026-09-24T18:28:43.0000000+00:00","size"